{"sba-keyaki-5713":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんは!\n \n \n \n \n 明日は2ndシングル最後の握手会なのです。\n \n \n \n 早い…早すぎる!!!\n \n \n \n \n 元気いっぱい葵ちゃんとペアです♪♪\n 葵ちゃんの元気さに負けずに私も元気いっぱい頑張るぞ!!\n \n \n \n \n きっと明日の第2レーンは賑やかです♡笑\n \n \n \n \n \n ボブ・ディランさんがノーベル文学賞を受賞されたというニュースを見てゆいぽんとびっくりしました⸜( ⌓̈ )⸝\n \n \n \n \n \n なんだかすごく嬉しいです!\n \n \n \n \n 明日歌えるの楽しみ!!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n たくさんにぎにぎしましょうね♡\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN0TZD1MABFWZ97F7M5R2RK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-29348":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんわん🐶\n \n 今日は個別握手会inパシフィコ横浜でした✨\n 約1ヶ月ぶりの個握🤝\n この1ヶ月の中にアニラや始球式などあって、とても濃い日々を過ごさせて頂いていて\n 今日はその話題で盛り上がることが多かったかなぁー⚾️✨\n \n \n \n \n そして、生誕祭もあり\n 生誕委員の方々は今年も盛り上げて下さり、\n ありがとうの気持ちでいっぱいでした😌\n \n スピーチ、、、なかなか緊張したなぁ笑💦\n 上手く話せてたかな?\n \n 欅に入ってから4回目のお祝いで\n 4回目の今日が一番お祝いして下さる方々の人数が多かった気がします🐱✨\n \n こうやって欅坂の握手会にも足を運んで下さる方が増えたんだなぁと実感し、嬉しくなりました😌\n \n \n 退場曲は楽天イーグルスの応援歌!📣\n 嬉しかった😆\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP2VQXTMJJYS8EAYDXD0J1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 花束贈呈で頂いたお花💐\n ふーちゃんからでした😌\n \n 素敵!!\n \n \n \n そして、楽天イーグルスのイーグルスガールデーで着たユニフォーム🦅💓\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP2WPRB2YCHCVBAFBRHDQ6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP2XQS3Y9R90H7M76RACEJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n めちゃめちゃ可愛い!\n \n 嬉しくて握手会でも着ちゃいました😊💓\n \n また着るかもしれないです!😉\n \n \n \n そしてメンバーとっ🌱\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP2YPC1DNGPZBS22553PMB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP2ZPSRJZXW6P062AETCTX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n メッセージでは、動画おくりますね😉!\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP30PXPKVWXEVGFAQM5BR6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n メンバーも生誕祭お祝いしてくれた〜〜っ✨\n 嬉しい。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 💐ここからはお花💐\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP31RD7WMKEFTVPJSAPCP9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 星のバルーン!⭐️\n ピンク、ユニフォームと同じ色😉\n 可愛いコメントボードもありがとう😊\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP32QT1R9SR77EHDP77D1B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 薔薇🌹\n 楽天イーグルスカラーの赤だ!!\n 可愛い。ありがとう!\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP33QZMWG16HV620GKA5C2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 大きなお花ありがとう!\n 楽天イーグルスカラーの赤だ!🌹🦅\n 大人っぽくていいね👍💐\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP34QJQE0R7SHMRY4JTBQ8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 犬のお花だ〜🐶\n これもユニフォームに合ってる👍💓笑\n コメントも嬉しかったです😌\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP35PM9BGHKC1E0VQP0MRR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n これからも共に頑張ります!!笑✨\n こんな私ですがよろしくね😉\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP36PS68EMP3DGK687KEZ9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n わしほー!!\n 勝利の女神になれるように全力で応援します!\n 今日もわしほー!だったよ💓😌\n ありがとう。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP37WNY9YSPAJX5P2KNH4W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n バルーンたくさんはじめて!!\n ずっとバルーンで遊んでました笑🎈\n 星がたくさん入ってたの可愛かったなぁ🌟\n \n \n \n \n \n 今回もたくさんの方に感謝です!😌😌✨\n \n とても楽しい握手会でした。\n 遠方から来てくださった方は気をつけて帰ってください😌\n \n また会えるの楽しみにしてるよ〜!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP38V0P33PAD6VPGKRD1ST","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 虹花🌈🌼\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 東北楽天イーグルスは今日もわしほー!でした!🦅✨\n \n 野球って楽しい!⚾️\n 野球のお話もたくさんしたなぁ😌\n もっと詳しくなって野球の濃い話まで出来たら楽しいだろうな〜〜!\n \n 野球好きの方は一緒に語って下さい!\n そして他の球団の話や選手の話なども聞いてみたい😊⚾️!"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-34679":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/30/3014457/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝からある撮影をしてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また解禁されたら話します！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は友達と夜ご飯を食べていて\nそのこともまた今度書くね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日書いていたブログの文が\nワンタッチによって\n全部消えてしまい\n久しぶりに落ち込んでます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慰めてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短いけど、きょうはこのへんで。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあしたかくね！今日よりも長く！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたのライブ楽しみましょう！"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7129":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんごっっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごっっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はちょっと松村のママとパパについて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話させてください(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、東京にきていた母から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなメールがきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"From.お母さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ついに、スカイツリーの展望台に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あがりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"景色がとても綺麗やったよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこのメールに添付されていた写真が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/7397264/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・・・・・・指入ってますがなーww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかく、スカイツリーに のぼったのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮った写真がこれなん！？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さーん(´；ω；`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりはめっちゃ笑いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう、お母さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気でた(^^)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、PARCO公演を見にきていた父"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後、お腹を空かせているだろうからと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんにパンを買っててくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡されたのは、スコーンとベーグル...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんは思いました、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいやいや、なんで２つとも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口んなか　カピカピなるやつなん！と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、食べたことある方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるでしょう...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２つとも激しく口の中の水分を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奪っていく奴らなのです！！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分、うちの父は若い子向けの物を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選んでくれたのでしょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その優しさに感謝して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくり味わいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大量のお茶と共に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さん、ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気でたよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこんなお茶目な両親が大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故、今日このお話を書かせてもらったのかと言うと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、９月１１日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人の結婚記念日なのです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京公演の時も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち込むさゆりんの話を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母は泣きながら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもずっと笑顔で聞いてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私をぎゅーっと、抱き締めてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父は黙ってずっと見守ってくれてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いてばかりの私に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「大阪に帰ろう」とは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言いませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、もし言われていたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村は本当に逃げてしまって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごく後悔してたと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰ろうと言わなかった両親の優しさと強さに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしていっぱい心配かけてごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沙友理は本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人のもとに産まれてきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったって思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村家の一員で良かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅行が好きな家族やから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんの仕事が落ち着いたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またみんなで旅行いきたいねー＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それまで、いっぱい心配かけるやろけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか、凄く個人的なブログでごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ、たまには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいよね☆笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、ずっと前のブログで書いた"}